text='# P1 conflicts\n\nThis is a decision-ready qualification report. Reconciled rows resolve deterministic carrier/temporal/priority interpretation; they confer no API, DDL, dependency, publication, private-channel or live-operation grant. Unresolved choices remain assigned to their source/contract/consumer owners and gate only the finite affected subset. No new owner scope or runtime acceptance is created.\n\n## Conflicts\n\n'+table(columns,conflicts)
